<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson to move unit's management to UK.</title>
<headline>Ericsson to move unit's management to UK.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson said on Tuesday it was moving management and headquarters for the business unit Transport &amp; Cable Networks from Stockholm to Horsham in England.</p>
</text>
